The auxiliary equation is
$\mathrm{D}^{2}+2 \mathrm{D}+1=0$ or $\mathrm{m}^{2}+2 \mathrm{~m}+1=0\Rightarrow(\mathrm{m}+1)(\mathrm{m}+1)=0 \Rightarrow \mathrm{m}=-1,-1$
i.e., repeated roots
